-- #1216, ARM 1 — the second owner of the field name `beta`.  `beta` is index 0
-- here, index 1 in `entry.mdk`'s `Rec`.  There is no import relationship the
-- other direction (this module does not know `Rec` exists); the point is that
-- `entry.mdk`'s OWN projection onto its OWN `Rec` was reading the wrong slot
-- merely because another module in the graph declares a field of the same
-- name at a different index.
public export data Other = Other { beta : String, alpha : String }
